{
"league": "nba",
"team": "1",
"name": "Hawks",
"date": "2021-03-01",
"interim": true,
"text": "* On March 1, 2021, the Atlanta Hawks fired head coach Lloyd Pierce after two seasons with the team, and named Nate McMillan as interim head coach."
