{
"league": "nba",
"team": "15",
"name": "Bucks",
"date": "2024-01-23",
"interim": true,
"text": "* On January 23, 2024, the Milwaukee Bucks fired Adrian Griffin. Joe Prunty, the team's assistant coach, was named the interim head coach."
},
{
"league": "nba",
"team": "27",
"name": "Wizards",
"date": "2024-01-25",
"interim": true,
"text": "* On January 25, 2024, the Washington Wizards fired Wes Unseld Jr. after seasons with the team. Brian Keefe was named interim coach for the rest of the season."
